A note on the scholarship data, which the licence above does not cover:

The catalogue in deliverables/dataset/ is compiled from public Indian
government sources. It is provided for reference and carries no warranty of
accuracy or currency. Deadlines and eligibility rules change without notice.
Always confirm details on a scheme's official page before applying — the bot
itself says this on every result, and so do we.
